"(trunk) Submissão do Livro LFS (obrigatório) (NOVO)\n"
"(/var/lib/jhalfs/BLFS) Diretório da base de dados dos pacotes\n"
"\t\t\tinstalados (NOVO)\n"
"  - Sair, aguardar o término.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#: CHEATSHEET:228
msgid ""
"step 11: set up the BLFS tools: change to ~/blfs_root, and run \"./update-"
"installed.sh\" select in the menu the packages you have installed (note: "
"select all the LFS packages with a <A>). Check the versions of installed "
"packages are the right ones. Change them if needed."
msgstr ""
"passo 11: configurar as ferramentas BLFS: mudar para ~/blfs_root, e executar "
